{
  "name": "Stale lead follow-up with AI-written emails",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stale lead follow-up with AI-written emails\n\n**What it does**\nEvery weekday at 9:00 it reads your leads sheet, finds people you contacted 3+ days ago who never replied and have not had a follow-up yet, writes each one a short personal follow-up with OpenAI, sends it from your Gmail and marks the row so nobody gets chased twice.\n\n**You need**\nGoogle Sheets, Gmail and OpenAI credentials, and a `Leads` tab with these headers: name, email, company, interest, last_contacted_at, replied, status, followed_up_at\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create the sheet (dates as 2026-09-28 work best) and connect credentials.\n2. Fill in the yellow notes (sheet ID, your name and offer in the prompt).\n3. Run once with **Execute workflow** on a sheet holding one test lead with your own email, then activate.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "2f8dbeed-959a-5982-94c5-7e0585f55758",
      "name": "Stale lead follow-up with AI-written emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nSet your sheet ID in **Read all leads** and **Mark as followed up**. Change the 3 day window in **Only stale leads**. **Max 25 a day** keeps sending volume (and Gmail limits) sane.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e20aa70f-5088-55f1-8723-10fc750f6b0b",
      "name": "Edit me: sheet and limits",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me: your voice\nPut your name, company and what you offer in the system message of **Write the follow-up**. Read the first few emails before you let it run unattended.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "def8201c-4bbd-5cce-abfa-af41d47ed0eb",
      "name": "Edit me: your voice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3cd3f462-357e-5975-a666-dce7e8d2df51",
      "name": "Every weekday at 9:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dfe44e31-b789-5988-b480-18e6543db9a4",
      "name": "Read all leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6a907396-934c-573c-a313-9b27835b647f",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "4f4707df-4945-5bbb-89e5-5c8171b272c5",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.replied || '').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "rightValue": "yes",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2f24daef-6ecc-5030-bb94-a99db22bbfc4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.followed_up_at }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2795ee3a-c40d-576e-8b16-866ee8d4c012",
              "leftValue": "={{ new Date($json.last_contacted_at).getTime() < $now.minus({ days: 3 }).toMillis() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "28382e17-a86a-5bb1-98e1-0245a483bf0a",
      "name": "Only stale leads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": 25
      },
      "id": "ea9dc2d9-21af-5bb3-a9bc-6b6f0ecda1ec",
      "name": "Max 25 a day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a follow-up email to this lead.\n\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company || 'unknown' }}\nWhat they asked about: {{ $json.interest || 'not recorded' }}\nLast contacted: {{ $json.last_contacted_at }}\nNotes: {{ $json.notes || 'none' }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You write short sales follow-up emails for Your Name at Your Company. We help small businesses with YOUR OFFER.\n\nRules:\n- 50 to 90 words, plain text, no markdown, no emojis.\n- Open with their first name. Refer to what they asked about in one specific sentence.\n- Offer one useful next step and end with one easy yes or no question.\n- No guilt trips (\"just checking in\", \"bumping this\"), no fake urgency, no invented facts.\n- Sign off as: Your Name, Your Company\n- Subject line: under 7 words, lowercase is fine, no clickbait."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "32105bbc-62fa-5549-a850-75ea15fbd1d4",
      "name": "Write the follow-up",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.6
        }
      },
      "id": "7eb411c0-8e89-5802-ae72-7e2094db1355",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        820,
        520
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "fromJson",
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"subject\": \"quick question about your website\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi Sam, ...\"\n}",
        "autoFix": false
      },
      "id": "860c7520-4b8b-5739-86d1-dd5136beabb3",
      "name": "Subject and body",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1000,
